@startuml 11-admin-stats
title GET /api/admin/stats - agregacja metryk dla Panel (Dashboard)

actor "Admin UI\n(Panel)" as UI
participant "AdminStatsController" as Ctrl
participant "GetAdminStatsUseCase\n(AdminStatsService)" as S
participant "AdminStatsRepository\n(JdbcAdapter)" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

note over UI #LightBlue: useAdminStats hook:\nrefetchInterval=30s\n(auto-odświeżanie)

UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/admin/stats
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> S: getStats()
activate S
note over S: TenantContext.get() → tenantId\nstartOfDay(0) → początek dziś (UTC)\nstartOfDay(7) → początek tygodnia

S -> Repo: countDocuments(tenantId)
Repo -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM documents WHERE tenant_id=?

S -> Repo: countDocumentsByStatus(tenantId)
Repo -> DB: SELECT status, COUNT(*) FROM documents\nWHERE tenant_id=? GROUP BY status
note over Repo #LightBlue: Inicjalizuje mapę z 4 statusami=0,\npotem nadpisuje wynikami GROUP BY\n→ klient zawsze dostaje wszystkie 4 keys

S -> Repo: countSessions(tenantId)
Repo -> DB: COUNT(*) chat_sessions
S -> Repo: countSessionsSince(tenantId, startOfToday)
Repo -> DB: WHERE started_at >= ?
S -> Repo: countSessionsSince(tenantId, startOfWeek)
Repo -> DB: WHERE started_at >= ?

S -> Repo: countMessages(tenantId)
Repo -> DB: COUNT(*) messages
S -> Repo: countMessagesSince(tenantId, today)
Repo -> DB: WHERE created_at >= ?

S -> Repo: sumTokens(tenantId)
Repo -> DB: SUM(tokens_used) FROM messages\nWHERE tokens_used IS NOT NULL
S -> Repo: sumTokensSince(tenantId, today)
Repo -> DB: WHERE created_at >= ?

S -> Repo: findLastActivity(tenantId)
Repo -> DB: SELECT MAX(activity) FROM (\n  SELECT MAX(uploaded_at) FROM documents WHERE tenant_id=?\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT MAX(last_activity_at) FROM chat_sessions WHERE tenant_id=?\n) AS combined
Repo --> S: Optional<Instant>

note over S #LightBlue: Cost estimate:\ntodayTokens * 0.000005 USD/token\n(Claude Haiku rough estimate)

S -> S: round4(estimatedCost)
S -> S: build AdminStats record\n(DocumentStats, SessionStats,\n MessageStats, TokenStats, lastActivity)

S --> Ctrl: AdminStats
deactivate S

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK + JSON\n{\n  documents: { total, byStatus: {PENDING, PROCESSING, READY, FAILED} },\n  sessions: { total, today, thisWeek },\n  messages: { total, today },\n  tokens: { total, today, estimatedCostUsd },\n  lastActivity: "2026-05-23T..."\n}
deactivate Ctrl

note over UI #LightBlue: Stat tiles na Dashboardzie\nz live wartościami:\n- Documents N + status breakdown bar\n- Sessions today/week/total\n- Tokens used + cost estimate\n- Messages today/total

@enduml
